    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        332,
        1315,
        1880,
        1445
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The City's tow-away program between 34th and 66th Streets, river to river, has proven extraordinarily successful.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1879,
          "min": -1.236
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0151
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8861,
        "area_px": 202264,
        "density": 0.04381,
        "chars": 113,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.75
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        332,
        1489,
        1880,
        1581
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Traffic is flowing swiftly through what were once jammed streets.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.133,
          "min": -1.0166
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 12,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0078
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5307,
        "area_px": 145136,
        "density": 0.03657,
        "chars": 65,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.25
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        332,
        1623,
        1906,
        1797
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Emergency equipment, including ambulances, was able to arrive in amazingly short time last Thursday at the scene of the building collapse at 123rd and 54th Street because there was no traffic congestion in the general area.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1924,
          "min": -1.4413
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 48,
          "mean": -0.0954,
          "min": -1.5178
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16597,
        "area_px": 274750,
        "density": 0.06041,
        "chars": 223,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.44
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        332,
        1838,
        1861,
        1935
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Order has been restored where once what appeared to be hopeless traffic chaos reigned.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1828,
          "min": -1.304
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 16,
          "mean": -0.0186,
          "min": -0.2845
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6834,
        "area_px": 150975,
        "density": 0.04527,
        "chars": 86,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.58
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        332,
        1966,
        1915,
        2112
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The tow-away campaign, which will continue without let-up, deserves the full support and cooperation of all heads of departments and agencies.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1926,
          "min": -1.3732
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0016
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11263,
        "area_px": 232113,
        "density": 0.04852,
        "chars": 142,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.61
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        332,
        2143,
        1987,
        2286
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I therefore strongly urge you to make use of the city's excellent public transportation facilities -- subways, buses or taxicabs -- whenever making a trip into mid-Manhattan.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1863,
          "min": -1.3461
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 35,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0206
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11463,
        "area_px": 237744,
        "density": 0.04822,
        "chars": 174,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.18
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        332,
        2313,
        1947,
        2424
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The members of your staff and of your agency should receive your personal urging to do likewise.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1854,
          "min": -1.3385
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
